{%- comment -%}
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
SIZE GUIDE TABLE
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Renders the ring size conversion table from the `ring_size` metaobject (single source of truth),
used by both the Ring Size Guide page and the product Size Guide popup.

Falls back to a hardcoded table if the metaobject has no entries or storefront access is disabled,
so the table always renders.

Accepts:
  table_class   - classes for the <table> element (e.g. 'ring-size-guide__table table--lg')
  wrapper_class - class for the wrapping <div> (e.g. 'ring-size-guide__table-wrapper')
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- assign rows = shop.metaobjects.ring_size.values | sort: 'position' -%}

<div class="{{ wrapper_class }}">
  <table class="{{ table_class }}">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>US/Promise Co</th>
        <th>Diameter (mm)</th>
        <th>Circumference (mm)</th>
        <th>UK</th>
        <th>Europe</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {%- if rows != empty -%}
        {%- for row in rows -%}
          <tr>
            <td>{{ row.us_promise_co }}</td>
            <td>{{ row.diameter_mm }}</td>
            <td>{{ row.circumference_mm }}</td>
            <td>{{ row.uk }}</td>
            <td>{{ row.europe }}</td>
          </tr>
        {%- endfor -%}
      {%- else -%}
        {%- comment -%} Fallback data if the metaobject is missing or not exposed to the storefront {%- endcomment -%}
        <tr><td>4</td><td>14.9</td><td>46.8</td><td>H ½</td><td>47</td></tr>
        <tr><td>5</td><td>15.7</td><td>49.3</td><td>J ½</td><td>49.3</td></tr>
        <tr><td>6</td><td>16.5</td><td>51.9</td><td>L ½</td><td>51.9</td></tr>
        <tr><td>7</td><td>17.3</td><td>54.5</td><td>N ½</td><td>54.4</td></tr>
        <tr><td>8</td><td>18.1</td><td>57</td><td>P ½</td><td>57</td></tr>
        <tr><td>9</td><td>18.9</td><td>59.5</td><td>R ½</td><td>59.5</td></tr>
        <tr><td>10</td><td>19.8</td><td>62.1</td><td>T ½</td><td>62.1</td></tr>
        <tr><td>11</td><td>20.6</td><td>64.6</td><td>V ½</td><td>64.6</td></tr>
        <tr><td>12</td><td>21.4</td><td>67.2</td><td>X ½</td><td>67.2</td></tr>
        <tr><td>13</td><td>22.2</td><td>70</td><td>Z ½</td><td>70</td></tr>
      {%- endif -%}
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>
